# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# CSP is intentionally NOT set yet: the site relies on large inline <style>/<script>
# blocks plus AdSense, GSAP and html2canvas CDNs, so a strict policy needs nonces
# (per-request injection) — enforcing a loose one with 'unsafe-inline' would add little.
# Track that separately; these four are safe, useful and regression-free today.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()

# Admin is already noindex via <meta>, but that only helps if a crawler renders the
# page — this blocks it at the header level too, and keeps the panel out of caches.
/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Cache-Control: no-store
